DELETE /v2/users/{userId}/assistants/{assistantId}
Delete one of a user's assistants
Required: userId (path) — The user ID or email address; assistantId (path) — Assistant's ID

DELETE /v2/users/{userId}/schedulers/{schedulerId}
Delete one of a user's schedulers
Required: userId (path) — The user ID or email address; schedulerId (path) — Scheduler's ID

GET /v2/users/{userId}/tsp/{tspId}
Retrieve a user's TSP account
Required: userId (path) — The user ID or email address; tspId (path) — TSP account index

DELETE /v2/users/{userId}/tsp/{tspId}
Delete a user's TSP account
Required: userId (path) — The user ID or email address; tspId (path) — TSP account index

PATCH /v2/users/{userId}/tsp/{tspId}
Update a user's TSP account
Required: userId (path) — The user ID or email address; tspId (path) — TSP account index; body (body) — TSP Account

PATCH /v2/users/{userId}
Update a user on your account
